{
  "title": "Frozen Abyss",
  "logline": "In a dystopian underwater city beneath frozen ice, a neo-noir detective must navigate the treacherous waters of nature reclaiming their world while uncovering a conspiracy that threatens all.",
  "synopsis": "Set in a submerged metropolis under an icy overworld, Detective Kira Novak navigates the neon-lit streets and subterranean canyons of Aquapolis. As natural elements begin to reclaim the city, Kira follows a trail of cryptic messages left by a rival detective who vanished years ago, leading her into a labyrinthine conspiracy involving powerful factions vying for control of the underwater world's resources. Alongside an enigmatic tech-savvy mermaid named Elara, Kira races against time to unravel the mystery and survive the encroaching darkness before it's too late.",
